<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" id="Definitions_16" targetNamespace="https://kitchen406.local/bpmn">
  <bpmn:message id="StatusMessage_20" name="Lalamove delivery-status update" />
  <bpmn:error id="DeliverySaveError_20" name="Delivery update could not be saved" />
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_16">
    <bpmn:participant id="Participant_16" name="BPMN-16 | Courier Delivery Status Tracking and Completion" processRef="Process_16" />
    <bpmn:participant id="Lalamove_20" name="Lalamove" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="ProviderStart_20" sourceRef="Lalamove_20" targetRef="Start_20" messageRef="StatusMessage_20" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="ProviderNext_20" sourceRef="Lalamove_20" targetRef="Wait_20" messageRef="StatusMessage_20" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_16" name="Courier Delivery Status Tracking and Completion" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>Sources: SRS 4.16 FR-DEL-10,12–15,17–18; FR-FUL-20–21,26; NFR-REL-01–03,05–06. Track a standard order or one weekly subscription fulfillment across Lalamove updates. BPMN-30 covers customer inquiries using the saved status. A confirmed failed or cancelled booking leads to an Owner-led retry under BPMN-15. The retry becomes required in this diagram; the current SRS permits rebooking and reserves booking initiation for Admin/Owner. Wait for a successfully saved replacement booking before resuming tracking. A failed courier booking does not cancel or refund the paid order.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_16">
      <bpmn:lane id="System_20" name="Kitchen406 System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Check_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Save_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SaveError_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>RetryWait_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Status_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Progress_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Wait_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Complete_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>EndComplete_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>UpdateRecordedEnd_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Owner_20" name="Admin/Owner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>ReviewBooking_20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_20" name="Lalamove sends a delivery update">
      <bpmn:documentation>Start tracking on the first incoming status update for a saved booking. Correlate later updates to the existing tracking instance and deliver them to Wait for next courier update. After a replacement booking is saved, associate its updates with the same fulfillment tracking instance.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_1</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="StartMessage_20" messageRef="StatusMessage_20" />
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:businessRuleTask id="Check_20" name="Match courier update to its booking">
      <bpmn:documentation>Identify the saved booking and the paid standard order or weekly delivery associated with the Lalamove update. Read the reported status for the records update.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_16</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:businessRuleTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Save_20" name="Update delivery status and order records">
      <bpmn:documentation>Process each Lalamove update and record it against its booking. Update the current delivery status and history to reflect the report. Delivered marks the fulfillment Completed and saves the actual completion timestamp and allocation lock with the existing shares and product amounts. Failed or Cancelled updates the courier booking only. Record repeated or older reports without rolling back newer progress, changing a completed order, or triggering another booking retry. Retain unmatched reports for reconciliation. A failed save preserves the prior records and retains the update for retry.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_9</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:boundaryEvent id="SaveError_20" name="Save failed" attachedToRef="Save_20" cancelActivity="true">
      <bpmn:documentation>A conflict or save failure leaves the latest saved records intact and retains the incoming update for a safe retry.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_7</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:errorEventDefinition id="SaveErrorDefinition_20" errorRef="DeliverySaveError_20" />
    </bpmn:boundaryEvent>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="RetryWait_20" name="Wait before retrying the save">
      <bpmn:documentation>After the retry delay, recheck the retained update against the latest saved records before trying again.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_8</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:timerEventDefinition id="SaveRetryTimer_20">
        <bpmn:timeDuration xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">deliveryUpdateRetryDelay</bpmn:timeDuration>
      </bpmn:timerEventDefinition>
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Status_20" name="Saved delivery status?" default="Flow_20_End">
      <bpmn:documentation>Route new saved progress, Delivered, or a newly confirmed Failed or Cancelled booking. A repeat or older report for an open delivery resumes waiting. If no open delivery exists, end the update without another completion or retry.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_9</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_10</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_12</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_14</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_End</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Progress_20" name="Show updated delivery status">
      <bpmn:documentation>Show the latest saved status to authorized viewers. The order is still in progress.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_11</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="Wait_20" name="Wait for next courier update">
      <bpmn:documentation>Wait for a new Lalamove status message for the active saved booking. After rebooking, use the replacement booking.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_11</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_15</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_16</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="WaitMessage_20" messageRef="StatusMessage_20" />
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Complete_20" name="Show Completed status and send follow-up updates">
      <bpmn:documentation>Make the committed status visible. For a weekly subscription delivery, BPMN-05 updates progress with the saved completion. BPMN-24/25 handle applicable notices. Fulfilled sales uses the original completion timestamp. Repeated events do not duplicate effects.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_12</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_13</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="EndComplete_20" name="Order Completed">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_13</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:userTask id="ReviewBooking_20" name="Review and retry courier booking (BPMN 15)">
      <bpmn:documentation>For a confirmed Failed or Cancelled booking, Admin/Owner retries through BPMN-15. Resolve uncertain attempts before another submission. Keep trying through BPMN-15 recovery until a replacement booking is confirmed and saved, then resume tracking with that booking. Allocation review follows the existing rules for incomplete fulfillments.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_14</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20_15</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="UpdateRecordedEnd_20" name="Update recorded">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20_End</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_1" sourceRef="Start_20" targetRef="Check_20" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_2" sourceRef="Check_20" targetRef="Save_20" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_7" sourceRef="SaveError_20" targetRef="RetryWait_20" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_8" sourceRef="RetryWait_20" targetRef="Check_20" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_9" sourceRef="Save_20" targetRef="Status_20" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_10" sourceRef="Status_20" targetRef="Progress_20" name="In progress">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">savedStatusIsInProgressOrOpenDeliveryStillWaiting</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_11" sourceRef="Progress_20" targetRef="Wait_20" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_12" sourceRef="Status_20" targetRef="Complete_20" name="Delivered">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">savedStatusIsDelivered</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_13" sourceRef="Complete_20" targetRef="EndComplete_20" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_14" sourceRef="Status_20" targetRef="ReviewBooking_20" name="Booking failed or cancelled">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">savedBookingFailedOrWasCancelled</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_15" sourceRef="ReviewBooking_20" targetRef="Wait_20" name="Replacement booking saved" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_16" sourceRef="Wait_20" targetRef="Check_20" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20_End" sourceRef="Status_20" targetRef="UpdateRecordedEnd_20" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="AcceptanceRules_20">
      <bpmn:text>Match the Lalamove update to its booking.
Record courier reports and keep the latest delivery status. Preserve the original completion timestamp.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="BookingRules_20">
      <bpmn:text>Retry belongs to the Admin/Owner under BPMN-15.
The paid order stays open. Resume tracking after a new booking is saved.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="SaveRules_20">
      <bpmn:text>Delivered → mark Completed and save the delivery time.
Keep preparing-owner allocations locked.
Failed or Cancelled → update the booking only.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Association_20_1" sourceRef="Check_20" targetRef="AcceptanceRules_20" />
    <bpmn:association id="Association_20_3" sourceRef="ReviewBooking_20" targetRef="BookingRules_20" />
    <bpmn:association id="Association_20_4" sourceRef="Complete_20" targetRef="SaveRules_20" />
  </bpmn:process>
